2	Hosting Plans & Pricing	Noehost offers the following hosting plans:\nSHARED HOSTING:\n- Starter: Rs. 500/mo — 1 website, 5GB SSD, 10GB bandwidth, 5 email accounts, Free SSL\n- Business: Rs. 1000/mo — 5 websites, 20GB SSD, unlimited bandwidth, 20 email accounts, Free SSL, daily backups\n- Professional: Rs. 2000/mo — unlimited websites, 50GB SSD, unlimited bandwidth, unlimited email, Free SSL, priority support\n\nWORDPRESS HOSTING:\n- WP Starter: Rs. 700/mo — 1 WP site, auto-install, auto-updates\n- WP Business: Rs. 1500/mo — 5 WP sites, staging, malware scan\n\nRESELLER HOSTING:\n- Reseller 50: Rs. 3000/mo — 50 cPanel accounts, WHM access\n- Reseller 100: Rs. 5000/mo — 100 cPanel accounts\n\nVPS HOSTING:\n- VPS Starter: Rs. 5000/mo — 2 vCPU, 4GB RAM, 80GB SSD\n- VPS Pro: Rs. 10000/mo — 4 vCPU, 8GB RAM, 160GB SSD\n\nAll plans include: 99.9% uptime guarantee, 24/7 support, free migration.	pricing	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
3	How to Access cPanel	To access your cPanel control panel:\n1. Login to client area at noehost.com/client\n2. Go to Services > My Hosting\n3. Click "Login to cPanel" button\nOR: Visit https://yourdomain.com:2083\nOR: Visit https://server-ip:2083\n\nDefault cPanel username is your domain name (without .com)\nIf you forgot your cPanel password, contact support or reset via client area.\nCommon cPanel features: File Manager, phpMyAdmin, Email Accounts, SSL/TLS, Softaculous (WordPress installer), FTP Accounts, Backups	guide	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
4	SSL Certificate Setup	FREE SSL certificates are included with all Noehost hosting plans (Let's Encrypt).\n\nTo activate SSL:\n1. Login to client area\n2. Go to your hosting service\n3. Click "SSL" in the left menu\n4. Click "Install SSL" or "Enable Let's Encrypt"\n5. Wait 5-10 minutes for SSL to activate\n\nTroubleshooting SSL issues:\n- If SSL shows "Not Secure": Clear browser cache, wait 24 hours for DNS propagation\n- If SSL expired: Go to hosting panel > SSL > Reinstall SSL\n- Mixed content warning: Change all http:// URLs to https:// in website files\n\nFor WordPress: Install "Really Simple SSL" plugin and activate it.	technical	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
5	Email Account Setup	To create a professional email (support@yourdomain.com):\n1. Login to cPanel\n2. Go to "Email Accounts"\n3. Click "Create" and enter email name and password\n4. Use these settings in your email client (Outlook, Gmail, Thunderbird):\n\nIMAP Settings (Recommended):\n- Server: mail.yourdomain.com\n- Port: 993\n- Encryption: SSL/TLS\n\nPOP3 Settings:\n- Server: mail.yourdomain.com  \n- Port: 995\n- Encryption: SSL/TLS\n\nSMTP (Outgoing) Settings:\n- Server: mail.yourdomain.com\n- Port: 587 or 465\n- Encryption: STARTTLS or SSL/TLS\n\nWebmail access: https://yourdomain.com/webmail\nGmail add email: Settings > Accounts > Add email account (use SMTP server)	guide	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
6	WordPress Installation & Management	To install WordPress at Noehost:\nMETHOD 1 - Client Area (Recommended):\n1. Login to noehost.com/client\n2. Go to your hosting service\n3. Click "WordPress" in sidebar\n4. Click "Install WordPress" and fill in site title, admin email, password\n5. Wait 2-3 minutes for installation\n\nMETHOD 2 - cPanel Softaculous:\n1. Login to cPanel\n2. Click "Softaculous Apps Installer"\n3. Click WordPress > Install\n\nWordPress Management:\n- WP Admin URL: yourdomain.com/wp-admin\n- Auto-login: Available via client area > WordPress > WP Admin button\n\nCommon WordPress issues:\n- White screen: Enable debug mode, check PHP version (use PHP 8.1+)\n- Login issues: Reset password via phpMyAdmin or WP-CLI\n- Slow website: Install caching plugin (W3 Total Cache or LiteSpeed Cache)\n- 500 error: Rename .htaccess file, increase PHP memory limit	technical	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
7	Domain Registration & Transfer	DOMAIN REGISTRATION:\n- .com: Rs. 2,500/year\n- .net: Rs. 2,800/year  \n- .org: Rs. 2,500/year\n- .pk: Rs. 1,500/year\n- .co.uk: Rs. 2,200/year\n\nTo register: Go to noehost.com > Domains > Search domain > Add to cart\n\nDOMAIN TRANSFER (from another registrar):\n1. Get EPP/Auth code from current registrar\n2. Unlock domain at current registrar\n3. Go to noehost.com > Domains > Transfer\n4. Enter domain and EPP code\n5. Approve transfer email (sent to domain admin email)\n6. Transfer takes 5-7 days\n\nDNS MANAGEMENT:\n- Nameservers: ns1.noehost.com, ns2.noehost.com\n- To point domain to Noehost hosting: Change nameservers at your registrar\n- DNS propagation takes 24-48 hours after any changes	guide	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
8	Billing, Invoices & Payment Policy	PAYMENT METHODS:\n- Credit/Debit Card (Visa, Mastercard)\n- JazzCash, Easypaisa\n- Bank Transfer\n- SafePay\n\nBILLING CYCLE:\n- Invoices generated 14 days before due date\n- Overdue invoices: Service suspended after 7 days past due\n- Terminated: After 30 days of non-payment\n\nREFUND POLICY:\n- Shared/WordPress hosting: 30-day money back guarantee\n- Domain registration: Non-refundable\n- VPS/Reseller: Pro-rated refund within 7 days\n\nTo pay an invoice:\n1. Login to noehost.com/client\n2. Go to Billing > Invoices\n3. Click invoice > Pay Now\n\nTo download invoice receipt: Go to invoice page > Download PDF	faq	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
9	Technical Support & Contact Information	SUPPORT CHANNELS:\n- Email: support@noehost.com\n- Live Chat: Available on website (click chat button)\n- WhatsApp: +92 315 1711821\n- Ticket System: noehost.com/client/tickets\n\nSUPPORT HOURS:\n- Live Chat & WhatsApp: 9 AM – 11 PM (Mon–Sat)\n- Email/Ticket: 24/7 response within 4 hours\n\nRESPONSE TIMES:\n- Critical (server down): 30 minutes\n- High (website error): 2 hours\n- Normal (general query): 4 hours\n- Low (billing query): 24 hours\n\nUSEFUL LINKS:\n- Client Login: noehost.com/client\n- Knowledge Base: noehost.com/kb\n- Server Status: noehost.com/server-status\n- cPanel Login: yourdomain.com:2083\n\nFor emergency server issues, always contact via WhatsApp for fastest response.	faq	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
10	Website Migration Service	Noehost offers FREE website migration for all new hosting customers.\n\nWHAT WE MIGRATE:\n- Website files (HTML, PHP, WordPress, etc.)\n- Databases (MySQL)\n- Email accounts\n- DNS records\n\nHOW TO REQUEST MIGRATION:\n1. Sign up for a hosting plan at Noehost\n2. Open a support ticket with subject "Free Migration Request"\n3. Provide: Current host name, cPanel username/password, or FTP details\n4. We complete migration within 24-48 hours with zero downtime\n\nSELF-MIGRATION GUIDE:\n1. Download all files via File Manager or FTP\n2. Export database from phpMyAdmin\n3. Upload files to new Noehost hosting via File Manager\n4. Import database in phpMyAdmin\n5. Update wp-config.php with new DB credentials (for WordPress)\n6. Point domain DNS to Noehost nameservers	guide	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
11	Backup & Restore Guide	AUTOMATIC BACKUPS:\n- Business and Professional plans include daily automatic backups\n- Backups retained for 7 days\n- To restore: Client area > Hosting > Backups > Restore\n\nMANUAL BACKUP via cPanel:\n1. Login to cPanel > Backup or JetBackup\n2. Click "Download Full Account Backup"\n3. Wait for backup to generate (5-30 minutes)\n4. Download the .tar.gz file\n\nBACKUP via Client Area:\n1. Login to noehost.com/client\n2. Go to your hosting service\n3. Click "Backups" in sidebar\n4. Click "Create Backup" \n\nRESTORE OPTIONS:\n- Full backup restore: Contact support with backup file\n- Database only: phpMyAdmin > Import your .sql file\n- Files only: Upload via File Manager or FTP\n\nIMPORTANT: Always take a backup before making major website changes!	technical	t	\N	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652	2026-06-01 12:02:22.643652
12	Noehost Platform Overview	Noehost (also called Nexgohost) is a professional web hosting and domain management platform. We offer: Shared Hosting (cPanel-based), WordPress Hosting (managed WP), Reseller Hosting (WHM + cPanel), VPS Hosting (KVM-based), and Domain Registration/Transfer. Our control panel is cPanel for all shared/WordPress/reseller plans. Admin panel is at /admin/noe. Client panel is at /client/dashboard. Support email: support@noehost.com. WhatsApp support is also available. We have 967+ active clients, 916+ hosting services, 1125+ domains.	guide	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
13	Hosting Plans - Shared Hosting Details	Shared Hosting Plans: 1) Hatchling - PKR 825/mo (monthly) or PKR 549/mo (yearly): 1 website, 10GB NVMe SSD, unmetered bandwidth, free SSL, free email. 2) Baby - PKR 1425/mo or PKR 1050/mo yearly: unlimited websites, 50GB NVMe SSD, unmetered bandwidth, free SSL, email hosting, free domain. 3) Business - PKR 2685/mo or PKR 1785/mo yearly: unlimited websites, 100GB NVMe, daily backups, dedicated IP, SiteLock security. 4) Pro - PKR 3885/mo or PKR 2685/mo yearly: unlimited websites, unlimited NVMe, premium SSL, business email, CodeGuard Pro. All plans include: FREE SSL certificate, cPanel access, Softaculous 1-click installer, 24/7 support, 99.9% uptime SLA, 30-day money back guarantee.	pricing	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
14	Hosting Plans - WordPress Hosting Details	WordPress Hosting Plans (Managed WP): 1) WP Starter - PKR 1497/mo or PKR 897/mo yearly: 1 WP site, 10GB NVMe. 2) WP Business - PKR 2997/mo or PKR 1797/mo yearly: 5 WP sites, 50GB NVMe, staging environment, Redis cache. 3) WP Pro - PKR 5997/mo or PKR 3597/mo yearly: unlimited WP sites, 100GB NVMe, staging, Redis. 4) WP Elite - PKR 10497/mo or PKR 5997/mo yearly: unlimited sites, unlimited NVMe, priority network. All WP plans include: auto WordPress updates, malware scanning, free SSL, cPanel access, one-click WP install, WP Admin SSO login.	pricing	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
15	Hosting Plans - VPS Hosting Details	VPS Hosting Plans (KVM-based, high performance): Plans start from around PKR 2000-15000/mo depending on resources. Each plan includes dedicated CPU cores, RAM, NVMe SSD storage, and bandwidth. Key features: Full root access, KVM virtualization, 10 Gbps uplink, DDoS protection, instant deployment, choice of OS (Ubuntu, CentOS, Debian, AlmaLinux, Windows), multiple data center locations. VPS plans give you complete control - SSH access, custom software installation, root privileges. Order at /order/vps or via the VPS Hosting page.	pricing	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
16	Hosting Plans - Reseller Hosting Details	Reseller Hosting Plans (WHM + cPanel): 1) Reseller Lite - PKR 5997/mo or PKR 4197/mo yearly: 20 cPanel accounts, 40GB NVMe, 400GB bandwidth. 2) Reseller Pro - PKR 11997/mo or PKR 8397/mo yearly: 50 cPanel accounts, 100GB NVMe, 1TB bandwidth. 3) Reseller Elite - PKR 17997/mo or PKR 12597/mo yearly: 100 cPanel accounts, 200GB NVMe, 2TB bandwidth. 4) Reseller Ultimate - PKR 29997/mo or PKR 20997/mo yearly: unlimited accounts, unlimited NVMe. All reseller plans include: WHM control panel, white-label branding, free private nameservers, cPanel for each client, free SSL for all clients, email hosting for clients, 24/7 support.	pricing	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
17	cPanel Access and Login Guide	To access cPanel: 1) Login to client dashboard at /client/dashboard. 2) Go to "My Services" or "Hosting". 3) Click your hosting service. 4) Click "cPanel" or "Control Panel" button - this gives SSO auto-login (no password needed). Alternatively: visit yourdomain.com/cpanel or cpanel.yourdomain.com and use your cPanel username/password. Common cPanel features: File Manager (upload/edit files), MySQL Databases (create/manage DBs), Email Accounts (create email), SSL/TLS Manager (install certificates), Softaculous (1-click app installer), DNS Zone Editor, FTP Accounts, Cron Jobs, Error Logs.	guide	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
18	WordPress - Installation, Admin Access, Common Issues	WordPress Installation: Login to client panel → My Services → Hosting → your domain → WordPress section → click "Install WordPress". Fill in: site title, admin username, admin email, password. Takes 2-5 minutes. WordPress Admin Login: Go to yourdomain.com/wp-admin or use the "WP Admin" SSO button in the hosting panel for auto-login without password. Common WordPress Issues: 1) White screen/500 error - disable plugins via FTP (rename /wp-content/plugins folder). 2) Cannot login - reset password via wp-login.php?action=lostpassword or via phpMyAdmin users table. 3) Slow site - install caching plugin (WP Super Cache or W3 Total Cache), use Redis (available on WP Business+). 4) Database connection error - check wp-config.php DB credentials. 5) SSL not working - install SSL in cPanel first, then update WP URL to https in Settings → General.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
19	SSL Certificate - Installation and Troubleshooting	SSL Installation: Login to client panel → My Services → Hosting → your domain → SSL section → click "Install SSL". We install free Let's Encrypt SSL automatically. Allow 5-10 minutes to propagate. Verification: Visit https://yourdomain.com and check for padlock icon. Troubleshooting SSL Issues: 1) "Not Secure" warning - SSL may not be installed yet, wait 10 min then try again. 2) Mixed content warning - change all http:// links to https:// in your site. For WordPress: install "Really Simple SSL" plugin. 3) SSL expired - go to SSL section and click "Renew SSL" or "Reinstall SSL". 4) Certificate error - try clearing browser cache, or reinstall SSL from cPanel → SSL/TLS Manager. 5) Redirect loop - check .htaccess file for conflicting redirect rules.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
20	DNS Management and Domain Configuration	DNS Zone Management: In client panel → Hosting → your domain → DNS/Domains section. You can add/edit/delete DNS records. Common DNS Records: A record - points domain to IP address (e.g., @ → 103.x.x.x). CNAME record - alias for another domain (e.g., www → @). MX record - mail server configuration. TXT record - for domain verification (Google, SPF, DKIM). DNS propagation takes 24-48 hours globally. To check propagation: use whatsmydns.net. Domain Pointing: If you bought domain elsewhere (GoDaddy, Namecheap etc.), point nameservers to our nameservers: ns1.noehost.com and ns2.noehost.com. Or add an A record pointing to your server IP (visible in your hosting panel).	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
21	Email Hosting Setup and Configuration	Create Email Account: Client panel → Hosting → your domain → Email section → Create Email Account. Set username (e.g., info@yourdomain.com) and password. Email Client Settings (for Outlook/Thunderbird/Apple Mail): Incoming IMAP: mail.yourdomain.com, Port 993, SSL. Incoming POP3: mail.yourdomain.com, Port 995, SSL. Outgoing SMTP: mail.yourdomain.com, Port 465 (SSL) or 587 (TLS). Username: full email (info@yourdomain.com). Password: your email password. Webmail Access: Visit webmail.yourdomain.com or yourdomain.com/webmail for browser-based email. You can also use the "Webmail" SSO button in the client panel for auto-login. Spam Issues: Check spam folder first. Whitelist sender addresses. Use RoundCube or Horde webmail clients.	guide	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
22	Billing, Invoices and Payment Methods	Invoice Payment: Login → Billing → Invoices → click unpaid invoice → choose payment method → pay. Payment Methods: 1) EasyPaisa - mobile wallet transfer. Send to our registered number, enter transaction ID, and submit proof. 2) Bank Transfer - transfer to our bank account, submit payment slip. 3) Other methods available as configured. Invoice Dates: Services renew on their due date. You receive reminder emails 14, 7, and 1 days before due. Late Payment: Services are suspended after 3-5 days of non-payment. Suspended services can be reactivated immediately after payment. Payment Disputes: Email billing@noehost.com with invoice number and payment proof. Credits: Overpayments and promotional credits appear in account credit balance. Credits are auto-applied to next invoice. Refund Policy: 30-day money back guarantee on new hosting purchases (not renewals or domains).	faq	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
23	Domain Registration, Transfer and Management	Domain Registration: Visit /domains or click "Domains" in menu. Search for your desired domain. Available TLDs: .com, .net, .org, .pk, .com.pk, .net.pk, .store, .online, .site, .tech and more. Add to cart and checkout. Domain Transfer: To transfer existing domain to Noehost: get EPP/Auth code from current registrar, go to /domains → Transfer → enter domain + auth code → pay transfer fee (includes 1-year renewal). Transfer takes 5-7 days. Domain Renewal: Auto-renew is enabled by default. You can manage this in client panel → Domains. Nameservers: Default nameservers are ns1.noehost.com and ns2.noehost.com. You can change them in the domain management section. WHOIS Privacy: Available to protect your personal contact information from public WHOIS lookup.	guide	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
24	Account Management - Registration, Login, Password Reset	Registration: Go to /client/register. Fill in name, email, password, phone. Email verification may be required. Client Login: Visit /login or /client/login. Use email + password. If 2FA is enabled, enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app. Password Reset: Click "Forgot Password" on login page → enter email → check inbox for reset link (check spam folder too). Profile Update: Client panel → Profile. You can update name, phone, address. Security: Enable 2FA from Profile → Security for extra account protection. Sub-accounts: Not supported yet - each user has their own login. API Access: Available for developers - generate API key from profile settings. Linked services: All your hosting, domains, and invoices are linked to your account email.	guide	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
25	Common Technical Issues and Solutions	500 Internal Server Error: Check error logs in cPanel → Logs → Error Log. Common causes: PHP version mismatch (change in cPanel → PHP Selector), corrupt .htaccess file (rename it temporarily), memory limit exceeded (add "php_value memory_limit 256M" to .htaccess). 403 Forbidden Error: Usually permissions issue. Set folder permissions to 755 and file permissions to 644 via File Manager. 404 Not Found: Check if file exists, verify .htaccess rewrite rules, check domain is pointing correctly. Database Connection Error: Verify database name, username, password, and host (usually "localhost") in your config file. Slow Website: Use GTmetrix or PageSpeed to diagnose. Enable caching, optimize images, use CDN, upgrade to higher plan. Email Not Sending: Check spam folder, verify MX records, ensure email account exists in cPanel. FTP Not Working: Use FileZilla with host=yourdomain.com, port=21, use SFTP (port 22) for secure connection.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
26	Noehost Support - How to Get Help	Support Channels: 1) Live Chat (AI) - available 24/7 on the website and client dashboard. Click the chat icon bottom-right. 2) Support Tickets - client panel → Support → New Ticket. Response within 24 hours. 3) Email - support@noehost.com for general, billing@noehost.com for billing issues. 4) WhatsApp - for urgent issues, click WhatsApp button on website. Response Hours: Pakistan Standard Time (PKT, UTC+5). Business hours for human support: Mon-Sat 9am-6pm. Emergency support for server down issues: 24/7. What to Include in a Ticket: Your domain name, exact error message, steps to reproduce, screenshots if possible. AI Chat Can Help With: Account info, service status, common errors, billing questions, how-to guides, DNS setup, WordPress help.	faq	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
27	Server Status and Uptime Monitoring	Check Server Status: Visit /server-status on the Noehost website for real-time status of all servers and services. Status indicators: Green = Operational, Yellow = Degraded Performance, Red = Major Outage. Site Health: In client panel → your hosting service → Overview tab, you can see your site health score, uptime percentage, response time, and disk/bandwidth usage. If your site is down: 1) Check /server-status first to see if there is a known outage. 2) Try pinging your domain from a different connection. 3) Clear your browser cache and DNS cache (ipconfig /flushdns on Windows). 4) Check cPanel error logs. 5) If everything looks normal on your end, contact support with your domain name. Uptime SLA: We guarantee 99.9% uptime on all shared, WordPress, and reseller plans.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
28	cPanel File Manager and FTP Usage	File Manager: Access via client panel → Hosting → your domain → File Manager button (SSO auto-login). Navigate: your website files are in /public_html folder. Upload files: drag and drop or click Upload button. Edit files: click on any file → Edit for code editor. Create folders: right-click → Create Folder. Delete: select file/folder → Delete (cannot be undone). FTP Access: Host: yourdomain.com or your server IP. Port: 21 (FTP) or 22 (SFTP - more secure). Username/Password: your cPanel credentials or create FTP account in cPanel → FTP Accounts. Recommended FTP Client: FileZilla (free, works on Windows/Mac/Linux). SFTP (SSH File Transfer): More secure than FTP. Use SSH key or password. SSH access must be enabled first in your hosting panel.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
29	Database Management - MySQL and phpMyAdmin	Create Database: cPanel → MySQL Databases → Create Database (enter name) → Create User (set password) → Add User to Database (all privileges). Connect to Database: Host: localhost, DB Name: cpanelusername_dbname, Username: cpanelusername_username, Password: the one you set. phpMyAdmin Access: Client panel → Hosting → your domain → Databases section → phpMyAdmin SSO button. Or via cPanel → phpMyAdmin. Import Database: phpMyAdmin → select database → Import tab → choose SQL file → Go. Export/Backup: phpMyAdmin → Export tab → Quick → SQL format → Go. Database Issues: "Access denied" - verify username/password and that user has privileges. "Table does not exist" - check if import was successful. Max DB size: depends on your hosting plan.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
30	Backup and Restore Guide	Automatic Backups: Noehost takes regular backups of all accounts. Backup frequency depends on your plan (daily for Business+). Create Manual Backup: Client panel → Hosting → your domain → Backups section → Create Backup. Full backup includes all files + databases. Restore from Backup: Backups section → find backup → click Restore. Full backups restore all files and databases. Database-only backups restore just the database. Restore time: 5-30 minutes depending on account size. Download Backup: Some plans allow downloading backup archives for local storage. Important: Always backup before making major changes to your site (theme changes, plugin updates, PHP version changes). CodeGuard: Available on Business and Pro plans for automated daily backups with easy one-click restore.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
31	VPS Server Management Guide	VPS Order Process: Visit /vps-hosting → choose plan → click Deploy Now → select OS, location, server details, add-ons → checkout. After provisioning (5-15 min), you receive server IP, root password via email. VPS Access: SSH into your VPS: ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP. Use PuTTY on Windows or Terminal on Mac/Linux. Root Password Change: After first login, run: passwd. OS Options: Ubuntu 20.04/22.04, CentOS 7/8, Debian 10/11, AlmaLinux 8, Windows Server (extra cost). VPS Control: Client panel → your VPS service → you can see IP, OS, status, resource usage. VPS Upgrade: Contact support to upgrade RAM/CPU/storage on existing VPS. VPS Renewal: Like hosting plans, renews on due date. Auto-renew enabled by default. If VPS suspended due to non-payment, data preserved for 7 days then deleted. cPanel on VPS: Not included by default. License available separately. Contact support.	technical	t	1	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112	2026-06-01 14:19:14.942112
